  "reviews": {
    "35800": "Professional seller Hokkiya LLC lot 107216627 explicitly identifies 35800, 34 mm steel and Roman dial. Ten actual gallery photographs visually inspected, including rose closed back and exterior reference stamp. Manufacturer https://www.tudorwatch.com/en/watches/clair-de-rose/m35800-0001 independently confirms 34 mm Clair de Rose, opaline dial, blue cabochon and steel bracelet. Marketplace title Genève is not treated as a model-family name; source describes black hands but actual photographs show blue hands. Representative base only; no suffix inferred.",
    "12510": "Catawiki lot 105982378 title identifies 12510, but original Dutch description explicitly says reference 21010 and mixes 41 mm and approximately 38 mm dimensions. All thirteen actual gallery photographs inspected; the guarantee-card face shown has purchase details but no readable reference confirmation. Closed back has Tudor/Geneve inscriptions but no independently legible exact case reference. Photographs withheld across all categories pending identity resolution. Source https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/105982378-tudor-style-12510-men-2018"
  },
